{"4212930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Meteor Expedition", "steam_appid": 4212930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Meteor Expedition&quot; is a sci-fi shooter game independently developed by GQ, an independent game enthusiast. Players will follow the 22nd century Earth Expedition Fleet to a distant galaxy, engaging in battles with alien enemies for scarce resources. Players can deploy intelligent mechanical units with various forms and functions to combat enemies and lead their troops to occupy resource zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become an expedition team member!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the Earth Expedition Fleet of the 22nd century to the unknown deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/bd272d33263be81a4e7d771fc68c2cfb.poster.avif?t=1776921523\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/bd272d33263be81a4e7d771fc68c2cfb.webm?t=1776921523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/bd272d33263be81a4e7d771fc68c2cfb.mp4?t=1776921523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise of the Intelligent Machines!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful AI intelligent machines will replace the weak flesh and blood bodies of humans, and venture into dangerous extraterrestrial regions to expand our territories for us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/08d86a9939874bfb4e617711c22fba0c.poster.avif?t=1776921523\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/08d86a9939874bfb4e617711c22fba0c.webm?t=1776921523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/08d86a9939874bfb4e617711c22fba0c.mp4?t=1776921523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deploy the Intelligent Machinery Troop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapidly deploy intelligent mechanical units through rare extraterrestrial crystals, form a powerful intelligent mechanical army, and destroy all enemies in front of you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/006ae3be16edaf39e3d214de7665394a.poster.avif?t=1776921523\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/006ae3be16edaf39e3d214de7665394a.webm?t=1776921523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/006ae3be16edaf39e3d214de7665394a.mp4?t=1776921523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/1571498b3e7de69a14ba741a3255918b.poster.avif?t=1776921523\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/1571498b3e7de69a14ba741a3255918b.webm?t=1776921523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/1571498b3e7de69a14ba741a3255918b.mp4?t=1776921523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A powerful collision!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On that unknown planet, there are enemies as huge as mountains. Lead your army of intelligent machines to have a fierce clash with them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/34f14a54dce1e33092be7d667a23edb0.poster.avif?t=1776921523\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/34f14a54dce1e33092be7d667a23edb0.webm?t=1776921523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/34f14a54dce1e33092be7d667a23edb0.mp4?t=1776921523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/41da0db39154c27aa3a72403ba89aed3.poster.avif?t=1776921523\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/41da0db39154c27aa3a72403ba89aed3.webm?t=1776921523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212930/extras/41da0db39154c27aa3a72403ba89aed3.mp4?t=1776921523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Meteor Expedition&quot; is a sci-fi shooter game independently developed by GQ, an independent game enthusiast. Players will follow the 22nd century Earth Expedition Fleet to a distant galaxy, engaging in battles with alien enemies for scarce resources. Players can dep